    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>17级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 类人生物（地系）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 204；''重伤'' 102</span><span>''先攻'' +12</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 29，''强韧'' 31，''反射'' 28，''意志'' 29</span><span>''侦查'' +13</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 疾病，石化，毒素</span><span>''感官'' 震动感知 20</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（大地行者）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">雷威（雷鸣）</div>\n<div class=description>若地亚空行者邻接着超过一个的敌人，则其攻击造成 2d8 额外雷鸣伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}石战锤（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+20 vs. AC<br>命中：2d10+9 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}雪崩击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近程爆发 2，+18 vs. 反射<br>命中：1d10+9 伤害，且目标倒地。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 24（+15）</span><span>''敏捷'' 18（+12）</span><span>''感知'' 21（+13）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 24（+15）</span><span>''智力'' 15（+10）</span><span>''魅力'' 17（+11）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 荒神语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 战锤</span></div></div>\n</div>",
